              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "• Title bar: traffic lights · file cluster (icon, name, version chip, Tagged chip, rev chip) · spacer · Validate. No Open button: use ⌘O, the drop zone, or drag and drop.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 12,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "yzwTJ",
              "name": "N",
              "fill": "$text-2",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "• Status bar: pointer · counts · opened in · message slot (validation progress, errors) · units · diagnostics · veraPDF. No 'Loaded: …' text and no render-mode summary.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 12,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "Vj6AT",
          "name": "Sec 7 · Tag overlay & reading order",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 10,
