                  "layout": "vertical",
                  "gap": 6,
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "uRyvn",
                      "name": "N",
                      "fill": "#A2AAB6",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "• Name first (Inter 12 semibold #E7EAEE) · key (JetBrains Mono 10 #6B7380) · one-line description (Inter 11 #A2AAB6), max width 260.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.45,
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 12,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "o6WvQ6",
                      "name": "N",
                      "fill": "#A2AAB6",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "• Applies to every icon-only control in the canvas toolbar: the six tools, Pick, Measure, Page boxes, Fit, zoom in/out, prev/next page.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.45,
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 12,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "GD46i",
                      "name": "N",
                      "fill": "#A2AAB6",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "• Pick mode doesn't change the render: X-ray still outlines every kind; Pick only filters what a click selects.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.45,
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 12,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "qBL3o",
          "name": "Sec 9 · Continuous scroll",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 6,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "LQPUi",
              "name": "H",
              "fill": "#E7EAEE",
              "content": "9 · Continuous scroll & floating cards",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 15,
              "fontWeight": "600"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "CJ2Hy",
              "name": "N",
              "fill": "#A2AAB6",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "• All pages in one vertical column, centred, 16 pt apart and 16 pt around. Only visible pages render; a page still rendering is a blank sheet (#181C21, 1 px #252A31) with 'Rendering…' in text-3.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 12,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "vr4vl",
              "name": "N",
              "fill": "#A2AAB6",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "• Current page = the page with the largest visible height after a scroll; clicking or dragging on a page makes it current without scrolling. The page field, Content tree, Operators / Paint order drawers, stepper, isolation, clip overlay, hit stack and rulers follow the current page.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 12,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "rKSfB",
              "name": "N",
              "fill": "#A2AAB6",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "• Prev / Next, the page field and Pages thumbnails scroll the target page's top to 16 pt below the view top; thumbnails highlight the current page as you scroll.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 12,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "z17dKd",
              "name": "N",
              "fill": "#A2AAB6",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "• Fit = fit the largest page in the document, so zoom doesn't jump across mixed page sizes.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 12,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "bRDuf",
              "name": "N",
              "fill": "#A2AAB6",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "• On every visible page: page boxes, validation badges, hover / preview / selection outlines, measure line. Only on the current page: paint-order ghosts. Selecting a node on another page scrolls there and centres it.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 12,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "CTotm",
              "name": "N",
              "fill": "#A2AAB6",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "• Screens 2.x show the view scrolled ~47 px so page 2's top edge peeks below page 1 (labelled 'p2' in the margin).",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 12,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "ZP37G",
              "name": "N",
              "fill": "#A2AAB6",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "• Floating cards (X-ray legend, page boxes, measure readout, stepper) anchor to the canvas's top-right corner, 14 px from the edges and below the ruler. They never sit over a page: if the gap between the page and the canvas edge is too narrow, they collapse to a chip ('4 kinds ▾') that expands on hover. The paint stepper anchors bottom-centre of the canvas, above the drawer strip.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 12,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "qxXJ5",
