                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Title chips merged into one 'PDF 2.0 · UA-2 · rev 3/3 ▾'. Status bar: cursor · file info (hover: counts, open time, veraPDF) · units · problems.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.5,
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 12,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "nxczq",
          "name": "Synced from implementation (Oct 30)",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 6,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "PNL27",
              "name": "T",
              "fill": "#E7EAEE",
              "content": "Synced from implementation (Oct 30)",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 15,
              "fontWeight": "600"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "T45sZh",
              "name": "Item",
              "fill": "#A9B1BC",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 500,
              "content": "• Isolate and Hide are icon-only toolbar buttons right after View (6 px group gap), disabled until a selection with content exists; tooltip then says “Select something with content on the page first”. In narrow windows they drop off the toolbar; the action bar and the I / H keys keep them.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 12.5,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "wrDox",
              "name": "Item",
              "fill": "#A9B1BC",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 500,
              "content": "• The View menu lists only page-wide modes (X-ray, Paint order, Clip, Alpha); isolation no longer adds “+1” to its button.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 12.5,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "cAh0c",
              "name": "Item",
              "fill": "#A9B1BC",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 500,
              "content": "• Menu shortcuts are quiet: no fill, #FFFFFF0A hairline, text-3 mono 10. Tooltips keep the regular keycap.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 12.5,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "EUckm",
              "name": "Item",
              "fill": "#A9B1BC",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 500,
              "content": "• The tag-colour editor is removed: role colours are fixed to the role-* tokens (no palette button, no “Edit tag colours…”).",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 12.5,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "Ygxn3",
              "name": "Item",
              "fill": "#A9B1BC",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 500,
              "content": "• Navigator and inspector resize by dragging their edge: min 240 / 280, canvas keeps ≥ 360; defaults 300 / 340.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 12.5,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "a71p4K",
              "name": "Item",
              "fill": "#A9B1BC",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 500,
              "content": "• Rulers count from the page’s top-left (display space, y down).",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 12.5,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "AOx7M",
              "name": "Item",
              "fill": "#A9B1BC",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 500,
              "content": "• Pages panel: the box provenance line sits inside the 44 px row, selected frame included.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 12.5,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "dQFwA",
              "name": "Item",
              "fill": "#A9B1BC",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 500,
              "content": "• Objects view: Preview section (inspector) and a preview under the dictionary (centre). Designed look: board 2.9.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 12.5,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
