        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "FXE59",
          "name": "Rules",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 8,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "fRFQG",
              "name": "Rules title",
              "fill": "#E7EAEE",
              "content": "Rules",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 18,
              "fontWeight": "600"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "Zy296",
              "name": "Rule",
              "fill": "#A9B1BC",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 1600,
              "content": "1.  Hero: the same 1440×900 scene and keyframes as desktop. A camera (translate + scale on the scene) frames each state in the top ~55% of the screen: couch + notes → the page → cards 1–3 → the glyph. It moves on the same scroll timeline, so transitions glide.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 15,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "F7E6ZZ",
              "name": "Rule",
              "fill": "#A9B1BC",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 1600,
              "content": "2.  Hero copy sits in a bottom panel; the four blocks crossfade in place (36 px headline, 15 px lede). Only the couch state has buttons.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 15,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "f1IrOA",
              "name": "Rule",
              "fill": "#A9B1BC",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 1600,
              "content": "3.  Showcase: same pinned chapters, camera zoom, spot, scrim, pointer click and path trace. The caption card sits under the screenshot (full width, in flow) instead of floating, because there is no room beside the spot.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 15,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "ieCJ1",
              "name": "Rule",
              "fill": "#A9B1BC",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 1600,
              "content": "4.  Everything is transform/opacity on the scroll timeline; reduced motion keeps the static list.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 15,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "qrDdO",
              "name": "Rule",
              "fill": "#A9B1BC",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 1600,
              "content": "5.  Phone landscape (≤ 960 wide, ≤ 520 tall): side by side. Hero copy on the left (30 px headline), the camera frames the right half. Chapters: screenshot on the left at full height, headline and caption card on the right.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 15,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
